# CMS & Content Guidelines

Content is **CMS-driven**. Editors update copy and posts without code deploys (ISR/revalidate on publish).

## Content Types

| Type | Route | Notes |
|------|-------|-------|
| **Blog / weblog** | `/blog`, `/blog/[slug]` | Long-form articles; categories/tags optional |
| **News** | `/news`, `/news/[slug]` | Shorter updates, press, announcements |
| **Pages** | `/`, `/services`, etc. | Hero, services, about — structured CMS blocks or page builder |
| **Contact** | `/contact` | Static copy from CMS; form fields validated in API route |

## Data Fetching

- Fetch in Server Components; use `generateStaticParams` + ISR/`revalidate` for listings and posts
- Single `lib/cms.ts` client — typed queries, shared image URL helper
- Map CMS fields to consistent frontmatter shape (title, slug, date, excerpt, coverImage, body)

```typescript
// ✅ Typed fetch + revalidate
export const revalidate = 3600;

export async function getBlogPosts() {
  return cms.query<BlogPost[]>(`...`);
}
```

## Blog & News UI

- Listing: shadcn `Card` grid or list; pagination or "load more" if needed
- Post page: typography via `prose` (tailwind typography plugin); share metadata for OG
- Related posts optional — keep query simple

## Contact Form

- shadcn `Form` + react-hook-form + zod schema
- POST `/api/contact` — validate, rate-limit, send email (Resend), return generic success/error (no stack traces)
- Required: name, email, message; optional: company, subject

## Images & Rich Text

- Portable Text / Lexical / CMS rich text — render with a single `RichText` component
- Always `alt` on images; responsive sizes from CMS asset pipeline

## Do Not

- Hardcode blog/news body copy in TSX (except dev placeholders)
- Add dashboards, auth, or product features under content routes
